Bruning's Reichstag Mandate: ([+ bruning_support_percentage +]%) ([+ bruning_support +]/500) 

- @spd: Can we get the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> to tolerate Bruning's government?
- @spd_yes: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> have agreed to tolerate Bruning's government.
- @ddp: Can we get the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @ddp_yes: The <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @dvp: Can we get the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @dvp_yes: The <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @wp: Can we get the <span style="color: #B8996F;">**WP**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @wp_yes: The <span style="color: #B8996F;">**WP**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @cnblp: Can we get the <span style="color: #006400;">**CNBLP**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @cnblp_yes: The <span style="color: #006400;">**CNBLP**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @csvd: Can we get the <span style="color: #8ED8E4;">**CSVD**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @csvd_yes: The <span style="color: #8ED8E4;">**CSVD**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @kvp: Can we get the <span style="color: #455B95;">**KVP**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @kvp_yes: The <span style="color: #455B95;">**KVP**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @dnvp: Can we get the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> to join Bruning's government?
- @dnvp_yes: The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> have agreed to join Bruning's government.
- @yay: We have managed to gather enough support.
- @nay: We are unable to gather enough support.


@spd
subtitle: The workers will regard this as a betrayal.
view-if: spd_bruning_support == 0 
go-to: negotiate_spd

@spd_yes
subtitle: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> has agreed to tolerate our government. 
