@yay
subtitle: We shall proceed 
view-if: bruning_support > 250
on-arrival: rubicon_crossed += 1

We have managed to obtain a parlimentary majority for Bruning's government. It remains to be seen how long this arrangement can last.

@nay
subtitle: We shall proceed
view-if: bruning_support < 251
on-arrival: bruning_vonc = 1; next_election_year = 1930; next_election_month = 9; spd_in_government = 0; in_grand_coalition = 0; in_weimar_coalition = 0; in_popular_front = 0; spd_toleration = 0; foreign_minister_party = "DVP"; interior_minister_party = "Z"; justice_minister_party = "I"; labor_minister_party = "Z"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = ddp_name; finance_minister_party = "DVP"; agriculture_minister_party = "Z"; labor_minister = "Stegerwald"; interior_minister = "Wirth"; finance_minister = "Moldenhauer"; economic_minister = "Curtius"; justice_minister = "Koch-Weser"; foreign_minister = "Stresemann"; agriculture_minister = "Dietrich"; reichswehr_minister = "Groener";  coalition_dissent = 0; pro_republic -= 5; old_middle_nsdap += 3 if pro_republic < 50; new_middle_nsdap += 3 if pro_republic < 50; unemployed_kpd += 3 if pro_republic < 50; workers_kpd += 3 if pro_republic < 50;

A vote of no confidence against our government has succeded due to our inability to secure a parlimentary majority for our government. New elections have been set for September 1930.
